OL,3,GNEWSACar park in Levy murder case still
OL,4,Aunsafe for women, residents say
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Sheryl Wilkins was found murdered
OL,7,Fin the B&M car park in Tottenham last
OL,8,FAugust, local resident Annem Hobson's
OL,9,Fheart sank.
OL,11,F"I had this big a pang of anger, just
OL,12,Fabsolute anger," she said, "because I
OL,13,Fam so frustrated."
OL,15,FAnnem has lived in the area for nine
OL,16,Fyears and in that time, she has been
OL,17,Fcampaigning for more security and
OL,18,Fsafeguarding for the sex workers who
OL,19,Fuse the space, mainly - but not always
OL,20,F- at night.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
